      "rendered": "RBI Summer Placement 2026: ₹25,000 Stipend, Eligibility, Selection Process, Duration &amp; How to Apply"
    },
    "content": {
      "rendered": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apply online for RBI Summer Placement 2026. Get ₹25,000 stipend, AC II Tier rail reimbursement, and central banking experience. Check eligibility and apply by Dec 15.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Read More:</strong> <a href=\"https://coursejoiner.com/free-online-courses/hp-life-free-finance-course/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">HP LIFE Free Finance Course with Certificate Enroll Now 2027</a></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Read More:</strong> <a href=\"https://coursejoiner.com/free-online-courses/free-digital-banking-course/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Free Digital Banking Course with Certificate 2027: Enroll Now</a></p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"658\" height=\"370\" src=\"https://coursejoiner.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/RBI_Summer_Placement_2026_Highlights_1_optimized_500.png\" alt=\"RBI Summer Placement 2026: ₹25,000 Stipend, Eligibility, Selection Process, Duration &amp; How to Apply\" class=\"wp-image-39666\" style=\"width:461px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https://coursejoiner.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/RBI_Summer_Placement_2026_Highlights_1_optimized_500.png 658w, https://coursejoiner.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/RBI_Summer_Placement_2026_Highlights_1_optimized_500-300x169.png 300w, https://coursejoiner.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/RBI_Summer_Placement_2026_Highlights_1_optimized_500-149x84.png 149w, https://coursejoiner.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/RBI_Summer_Placement_2026_Highlights_1_optimized_500-299x168.png 299w, https://coursejoiner.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/RBI_Summer_Placement_2026_Highlights_1_optimized_500-324x182.png 324w, https://coursejoiner.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/RBI_Summer_Placement_2026_Highlights_1_optimized_500-599x337.png 599w, https://coursejoiner.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/RBI_Summer_Placement_2026_Highlights_1_optimized_500-647x364.png 647w, https://coursejoiner.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/RBI_Summer_Placement_2026_Highlights_1_optimized_500-284x160.png 284w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 658px) 100vw, 658px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#about-the-reserve-bank-of-india-rbi\">About the Reserve Bank of India (RBI)</a></li><li><a href=\"#key-highlights-of-rbi-summer-internship-2026\">Key Highlights of RBI Summer Internship 2026</a></li><li><a href=\"#eligibility-criteria-for-applicants\">Eligibility Criteria for Applicants</a><ul><li><a href=\"#1-educational-qualification\">1. Educational Qualification</a></li><li><a href=\"#2-year-of-study\">2. Year of Study</a></li></ul></li><li><a href=\"#rbi-regional-control-offices-allocation\">RBI Regional Control Offices &amp; Allocation</a></li><li><a href=\"#stipend-travel-reimbursement-facilities\">Stipend, Travel Reimbursement &amp; Facilities</a></li><li><a href=\"#selection-process-internship-duration\">Selection Process &amp; Internship Duration</a></li><li><a href=\"#important-dates\">Important Dates</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-apply-online-for-rbi-summer-placement-2026\">How to Apply Online for RBI Summer Placement 2026?</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"about-the-reserve-bank-of-india-rbi\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">About the Reserve Bank of India (RBI)</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The Reserve Bank of India is India&#8217;s central banking institution, responsible for regulating the monetary policy, financial system, and currency supply of the nation. Operating through its Central Office in Mumbai and regional Control Offices across states and Union Territories, the RBI maintains financial stability and fosters economic growth. Undertaking an internship at RBI allows students to experience central banking operations, monetary research, and policy formulation firsthand.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"key-highlights-of-rbi-summer-internship-2026\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">Key Highlights of RBI Summer Internship 2026</h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><thead><tr><td><strong>Parameter</strong></td><td><strong>Official Details</strong></td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Organization</strong></td><td>Reserve Bank of India (RBI)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Program Name</strong></td><td>RBI Summer Placement 2026</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Total Seats</strong></td><td>Maximum of 200 trainees selected annually</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Monthly Stipend</strong></td><td>₹25,000 per month (w.e.f. April 2027 cycle)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Travel Allowance</strong></td><td>Return AC II Tier rail fare reimbursement for outstation trainees</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Internship Duration</strong></td><td>Up to 3 months (April to July)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Application Window</strong></td><td>October 15 to December 15</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Selection Month</strong></td><td>Interview: Jan–Feb | Selection list: Feb–March</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Official Website</strong></td><td><a href=\"https://opportunities.rbi.org.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">opportunities.rbi.org.in</a></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"eligibility-criteria-for-applicants\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">Eligibility Criteria for Applicants</h2>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"1-educational-qualification\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Educational Qualification</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Candidates must be Indian citizens studying in recognized colleges or universities within India. Applicants must be enrolled in one of the following qualifications:</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Postgraduate Courses:</strong> Management, Statistics, Commerce, Economics, Econometrics, Banking, or Finance.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Integrated Five-Year Courses:</strong> 5-year integrated programs in relevant disciplines or Law.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Law Stream:</strong> 3-year full-time professional Bachelor’s degree in Law (LL.B) or 5-year integrated Law program.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 id=\"2-year-of-study\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Year of Study</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Candidates <strong>must be in their penultimate year</strong> (second-to-last year) of their respective course as on the date of application.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"rbi-regional-control-offices-allocation\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">RBI Regional Control Offices &amp; Allocation</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Candidates must apply to the specific RBI Control Office that corresponds to the state or Union Territory where their institute is located.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><thead><tr><td><strong>Sr. No.</strong></td><td><strong>State / UT</strong></td><td><strong>Control Office / Centre</strong></td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>Maharashtra</td><td>Central Office, Mumbai</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>Gujarat, Daman &amp; Diu, Dadra &amp; Nagar Haveli</td><td>Ahmedabad</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>Karnataka</td><td>Bangalore</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>Madhya Pradesh</td><td>Bhopal</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>Odisha</td><td>Bhubaneswar</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>Haryana, Punjab, Chandigarh</td><td>Chandigarh</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>Tamil Nadu &amp; Puducherry</td><td>Chennai</td></tr><tr><td>8</td><td>North Eastern States (Assam, AP, Manipur, Meghalaya, Mizoram, Nagaland, Tripura, Sikkim)</td><td>Guwahati</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>Telangana</td><td>Hyderabad</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>Rajasthan</td><td>Jaipur</td></tr><tr><td>11</td><td>Jammu &amp; Kashmir, Ladakh</td><td>Jammu</td></tr><tr><td>12</td><td>Uttar Pradesh</td><td>Kanpur</td></tr><tr><td>13</td><td>West Bengal, Andaman &amp; Nicobar Islands</td><td>Kolkata</td></tr><tr><td>14</td><td>New Delhi</td><td>New Delhi</td></tr><tr><td>15</td><td>Bihar</td><td>Patna</td></tr><tr><td>16</td><td>Kerala, Lakshadweep</td><td>Thiruvananthapuram</td></tr><tr><td>17</td><td>Uttarakhand</td><td>Dehradun</td></tr><tr><td>18</td><td>Chhattisgarh</td><td>Raipur</td></tr><tr><td>19</td><td>Andhra Pradesh</td><td>Vijayawada</td></tr><tr><td>20</td><td>Himachal Pradesh</td><td>Shimla</td></tr><tr><td>21</td><td>Goa</td><td>Panaji</td></tr><tr><td>22</td><td>Jharkhand</td><td>Ranchi</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"stipend-travel-reimbursement-facilities\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">Stipend, Travel Reimbursement &amp; Facilities</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Monthly Stipend:</strong> Trainees receive a stipend of <strong>₹25,000 per month</strong>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Travel Expenses:</strong> Selected outstation candidates are reimbursed <strong>AC II Tier return train fare</strong> (or equivalent amount) between their institution’s location and the internship centre.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Accommodation:</strong> Outstation trainees are required to arrange their own accommodation during the placement period.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Secrecy Declaration:</strong> Trainees must sign a formal Declaration of Secrecy with the Bank before joining.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"selection-process-internship-duration\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">Selection Process &amp; Internship Duration</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Shortlisting:</strong> Applications are reviewed by the respective Control Offices based on declared academic credentials.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Interview:</strong> Shortlisted candidates are invited for an interview in <strong>January or February</strong> at the respective RBI office. Outstation candidates bear their own travel costs for attending the interview.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Final Result:</strong> Selected candidate names are declared in <strong>February or March</strong>. Up to <strong>200 candidates</strong> are chosen across India.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Duration:</strong> Placements run for up to <strong>3 months</strong>, spanning from <strong>April to July</strong>.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"important-dates\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">Important Dates</h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><thead><tr><td><strong>Event</strong></td><td><strong>Date / Schedule</strong></td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Online Application Starts</strong></td><td>October 15</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Application Deadline</strong></td><td>December 15</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Shortlist Interviews</strong></td><td>January – February</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Final Results Declaration</strong></td><td>February – March</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Internship Tenure</strong></td><td>April – July (up to 3 months)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Read More:</strong> <a href=\"https://coursejoiner.com/free-online-courses/advanced-accounting-course/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Skill India Free Advanced Accounting Course with Certificate 2027</a></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Read More:</strong> <a href=\"https://coursejoiner.com/free-online-courses/cousera-free-course/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Cousera FREE Course with Certificate Google Ads Enroll Now 2027</a></p>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"how-to-apply-online-for-rbi-summer-placement-2026\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">How to Apply Online for RBI Summer Placement 2026?</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">To Apply for the <strong>RBI Summer Placement 2026 </strong>the links below</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apply Link for <strong>RBI Summer Placement 2026</strong>– <a href=\"https://opportunities.rbi.org.in/scripts/summer.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>https://opportunities.rbi.org.in/scripts/summer.aspx</strong></a></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>RBI Summer Placement 2026 </strong>Official Website – <a href=\"https://opportunities.rbi.org.in/scripts/summer.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>https://opportunities.rbi.org.in/scripts/summer.aspx</strong></a></p>\n",
